### Room background of the steel study, cosmic rays, one job (2026-11-20; condor/room_background_submit.sh, band
### cosmic). The setup of macro/room_decay.mac (the beam run's, with the 30 cm concrete floor): every cosmic-ray species
### of the EXPACS table at sea level (data/expacs_spectrum.txt: neutrons, protons, He, mu+-, e+-, photons, ions; open
### sky, no building above) from a 2 x 2 m plane at 105 cm, just above the lead roof (91-101 cm), downward within 80 deg
### of the vertical: muons with the zenith shape of Guan et al., the others cos^2 (as macro/cosmic_expacs.mac).
### Thermal neutrons need more than the physics list's 10 us neutron time cut to reach the panel. The run tree's
### live_time is the time the events stand for. Only events with energy in the panel are written (/EventFilter 7).
### The job macro sets the aliases bmSeed, bmEvents, bmDir, bmFile, bmPanel and bmPanelZ, the target's
### /tof/target/composition and density, then executes this. Needs TOFmeter --preinit macro/preinit_lyso.mac (as the
### decays: radioactive decay and fluorescence, so the cosmic rays' activation decays too).
/tof/det/worldSize 420 420 300 cm
/tof/det/stack false
/tof/target/size 20 20 1 cm
/tof/target/position 0 0 33.0 cm
/control/execute macro/panel_{bmPanel}.mac
/tof/czt/position 0 0 {bmPanelZ} cm
/tof/blocks/add Floor G4_CONCRETE 0 0 -15 420 420 30 cm
/update
/OutputFormat 1
/EventFilter 7
/OutputDirectory {bmDir}
/OutputFile {bmFile}
/gun/seed {bmSeed}
/physics_engine/neutron/timeLimit 10 ms
/GeneralParticleSource 2
/tof/cosmic/model expacs
/tof/cosmic/species all
/tof/cosmic/angular all 2 mu+ guan mu- guan
/tof/cosmic/planeCenter 0 0 105 cm
/tof/cosmic/halfX 100 cm
/tof/cosmic/halfY 100 cm
/tof/cosmic/thetaMax 80 deg
/tof/cosmic/energyMin 0 GeV
/tof/cosmic/energyMax 1000 GeV
# Auger electrons off, as in the beam and decay jobs; fluorescence stays on
/process/em/auger false
/process/em/augerCascade false
# verbose 1: the log ends with "Number of events processed : <bmEvents>", which the job script looks for
/run/verbose 1
/run/printProgress 100000
/run/beamOn {bmEvents}
